<title>UK: Algemeine Hypo adds 250 mln marks to Jan 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>Algemeine Hypo adds 250 mln marks to Jan 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced by lead manager Dresdner Bank, has been increased.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALGEMEINE HYPOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.75 BLN DEM  COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    13.JAN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.30    PAY DATE   *13.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.0	 SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
